  },
  {
   "x": 0.52,
   "y": 1.06,
   "w": 6.16,
   "h": 0.27875,
   "text": "Why the radius replaces time",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13.5,
   "color": "#8EDBD4",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o058",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 58"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.6,
   "y": 1.55,
   "w": 5.9,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "1  y(R) = Ṙ²,  Ṙ ≠ 0",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o059",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 59"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.85,
   "y": 1.8900000000000001,
   "w": 5.7,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "dy/dR = 2R̈",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o060",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 60"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.6,
   "y": 2.460277777777778,
   "w": 5.9,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "2  Rewrite R R̈ + (3/2)Ṙ² = −Δp_c/ρ",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o061",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 61"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.85,
   "y": 2.8002777777777776,
   "w": 5.7,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "y′ + 3y/R = −2Δp_c/(ρR)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o062",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 62"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.6,
   "y": 3.3705555555555553,
   "w": 5.9,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "3  Multiply by the integrating factor R³",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o063",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 63"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.85,
   "y": 3.710555555555555,
   "w": 5.7,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "d(R³y)/dR = R³y′ + 3R²y = −(2Δp_c/ρ) R²",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o064",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 64"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.6,
   "y": 4.280833333333333,
   "w": 5.9,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "4  Integrate from Rₘₐₓ (y = 0)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o065",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 65"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.85,
   "y": 4.620833333333333,
   "w": 5.7,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "R³y = (2Δp_c/3ρ)(Rₘₐₓ³ − R³)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o066",
   "name": "C1-E14 text 66"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.6,
   "y": 5.24111111111111,
   "w": 5.9,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "On the monotonic inward branch R is a valid independent\nvariable. The factor R³ makes the left side an exact derivative.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#B4C7D2",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
